{"type":"step-attempt","step":"code-review","sessionId":"38dbb071-4801-488f-a941-d2a863d60e3b","outcome":{"verdict":"escalation","findingsPath":"specrunner/changes/runtime-mutation-lifecycle-capability-split/review-feedback-001.md","error":null,"toolResult":{"ok":true,"findings":[{"severity":"high","resolution":"fixable","file":"src/core/port/runtime-strategy.ts","title":"buildDeps return type is still `unknown` in the RuntimeStrategy port interface","rationale":"The JSDoc comment at lines 381–388 says the former `unknown` return type is no longer needed (cycle is broken), but the actual signature still declares `: unknown` instead of `: PipelineDeps`. This directly violates the acceptance criterion ('buildDeps の対象 payload signature に domain object を表す unknown が残らない'), TC-022, and tasks.md T-05. The import-cycle that required `unknown` was broken by removing `PipelineDeps.runtimeStrategy`; the port-layer change was not completed.","line":394},{"severity":"high","resolution":"fixable","file":"src/core/command/runner.ts","title":"`as PipelineDeps` cast is still present after buildDeps call","rationale":"Line 222: `deps = this.runtime.buildDeps(...) as PipelineDeps;`. Because Finding 1 (buildDeps returns `unknown` in the interface) was not resolved, this cast remains necessary. Once the port return type is changed to `PipelineDeps`, this cast can and must be removed. Violates acceptance criterion ('対象境界の `as PipelineDeps` cast が除去される') and TC-021.","line":222},{"severity":"medium","resolution":"fixable","file":"src/core/pipeline/pipeline-capability.ts","title":"RoundGitEffectsCapability declares listWorktreeChanges?, commitRoundArtifacts?, digestArtifacts? as optional — violates D6 and tasks.md T-03","rationale":"Design D6 requires all capability method signatures to be required (no `?`), with `snapshotMainCheckoutGuard` as the sole documented exception. Tasks.md T-03 lists all five `RoundGitEffectsCapability` methods without `?`. Three methods (`listWorktreeChanges?` line 92, `commitRoundArtifacts?` line 107, `digestArtifacts?` line 122) carry the `?` modifier, causing `parallel-review-round.ts` to use method-presence checks (`deps.roundGitEffects?.listWorktreeChanges`, `deps.roundGitEffects.commitRoundArtifacts?.()`) instead of the field-presence pattern mandated by D6. The managed-runtime fake in `managed-runtime-capabilities.test.ts` already implements no-op versions of all three methods, so making them required is directly feasible.","line":92},{"severity":"low","resolution":"decision-needed","file":"src/core/runtime/local.ts","title":"LocalRuntime._latestBuiltDeps side-channel: finalizeStepArtifacts implicitly depends on composition root having set deps.pushCapability post-buildDeps","rationale":"finalizeStepArtifacts reads `this._latestBuiltDeps` to obtain `pushCapability` that runner.ts sets on the deps object after buildDeps() returns (JavaScript reference semantics). This undocumented precondition: (1) is invisible from the StepArtifactLifecycleCapability interface, (2) causes a runtime throw if capability is called before buildDeps, and (3) imposes an implicit ordering contract between the composition root and the capability. The design spec does not document this pattern. Options: extend CommitPushInfra to carry pushCapability (eliminates the side channel), or explicitly document and add a test asserting the precondition.","line":161,"options":[{"label":"Extend CommitPushInfra to include pushCapability","consequence":"Eliminates the side channel entirely; callers thread pushCapability through the infra struct; requires updating commitAndPush callers."},{"label":"Document and test the precondition","consequence":"Keeps the current pattern but adds a contract test asserting buildDeps must be called before finalizeStepArtifacts on LocalRuntime; lower change impact."}]}],"evidence":{"checked":46,"skipped":0,"unverified":0},"observations":[{"severity":"low","file":"src/core/pipeline/__tests__/parallel-review-round-invalidation.test.ts","title":"Test local variable named 'runtimeStrategy' — naming is harmless, not a field on PipelineDeps","rationale":"The local variable `runtimeStrategy` at line 203 is passed as `roundGitEffects: runtimeStrategy as never` into PipelineDeps. The PipelineDeps field is correctly `roundGitEffects`, not `runtimeStrategy`. The variable name is a legacy naming artifact but does not inject a `runtimeStrategy` field into deps.","line":131},{"severity":"low","file":"src/core/runtime/__tests__/local-runtime-capabilities.test.ts","title":"Capability contract tests use structural fakes, not real LocalRuntime — precondition for _latestBuiltDeps not exercised","rationale":"The local-runtime-capabilities.test.ts tests derive capabilities from structural fake objects that mimic LocalRuntime. The _latestBuiltDeps precondition (Finding 4) is not exercised against the real LocalRuntime in these tests.","line":1}]},"followUpAttempts":1,"transientRetryAttempts":0,"addedTurns":{"reportRetry":0,"postWork":0,"outputRepair":1}},"startedAt":"2026-08-30T14:57:11.278Z","endedAt":"2026-08-30T15:04:04.725Z","commitOid":"2d3c86f75ec0658bc7c2543ee0e0d9f8f9c45006"}
